{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "19", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "10", "M": "16", "S": "34"}}, "news": [{"title": "Delhi: NDMC unlikely to roll out unit area property tax system this fiscal", "para": "Property tax reforms by the New Delhi Municipal Council are currently stalled this financial year, much to the frustration of traders grappling with high tax bills based on unrealistic rental values. The central government\u2019s green light and gazette notification for the unit area method, which aims to standardize property tax assessments, remain unresolved, indicating a protracted implementation process.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/delhi-ndmc-unlikely-to-roll-out-unit-area-property-tax-system-this-fiscal/133337499?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1592248/133337499.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "MiC approves property tax framework for unauthorized colonies in Indore", "para": "The Mayor-in-Council has given the green light for property tax reforms aimed at residents with legitimate ownership documents. In addition, significant infrastructure projects and public-private partnerships were sanctioned. A new link road will connect Kanadia Road to Khajrana Temple, improving traffic conditions. Plans have also been set for new commercial markets in Subhash Nagar and Vallabh Nagar.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/mic-approves-property-tax-framework-for-unauthorized-colonies-in-indore/133337422?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-107440/133337422.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Ahmedabad civic body suspends development permission of Bodakdev high-rise over TOZ eligibility", "para": "The Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation has suspended the development approval for a high-rise due to doubts about its compliance with Transit Oriented Zone regulations. Initially sanctioned with an excessive Floor Space Index, the project is now under scrutiny. Officials are insisting on a complete re-assessment of its TOZ eligibility, leading to ongoing suspension of development activities until verification is complete.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/ahmedabad-civic-body-suspends-development-permission-of-bodakdev-high-rise-over-toz-eligibility/133337337?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-334110/133337337.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}]}